  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "LogQL Investigation Workflows & Quick Links",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Quick LogQL Troubleshooting Guide & Explore Navigation\n- **Open in Grafana Explore:** [Explore Loki Logs](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22Loki%22%7D) | [Explore Tempo Traces](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22Tempo%22%7D)\n- **Errors across cluster:** `{cluster=\"homelabs\", level=~\"error|fatal|critical\"}` or `{cluster=\"homelabs\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|exception|panic|fatal)\"`\n- **Kubernetes Warning Events:** `{cluster=\"homelabs\", source=\"k8s-events\"} |= \"type=Warning\"`\n- **Correlate by Trace ID:** Paste a `trace_id` (e.g., from `finance-backend` or `traefik` access logs) into the **Search Text / TraceID** box above, or expand any log line and click **Inspect Trace in Tempo**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Log Ingestion Rate (Lines/s)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "Loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "Loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate({cluster=\"homelabs\", namespace=~\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$pod\"}[5m]))",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error Log Rate (Lines/min)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
